  "title": "Stop Writing Prompts. Start Writing Specs.",
  "description": "Prompt engineering got us started, but it often leads to fragile systems that are hard to maintain and do not inspire confidence. In this session, we explore a different path. Using GitHub Spec Kit we build an agent from a specification, treating the spec as the contract that defines capabilities, tools, and outputs. Instead of rewriting prompts, we evolve the system by evolving the spec.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
